Guard the MetalLayer reference in macOS builds without Vulkan; Meson only
compiles the MetalLayer class when Vulkan support is available.

Upstream report with the same compiler error:
https://github.com/mpv-player/mpv/issues/18357
The report was closed pending reproduction with released macOS SDK/tools;
its closure does not indicate that this build failure was fixed upstream.

--- video/out/mac/view.swift.orig
+++ video/out/mac/view.swift
@@ -29,9 +29,11 @@
     override var acceptsFirstResponder: Bool { return true }
 
     override var isOpaque: Bool {
+        #if HAVE_VULKAN
         if let metalLayer = layer as? MetalLayer {
             return !metalLayer.isOpaque
         }
+        #endif
 
         return true
     }
